distribution-track\"><span class=\"distribution-fill\" style=\"width:24.8328%;background:var(--sv-price-up)\"></span></div><span class=\"distribution-value\">297 家 · 5.34%</span></div><div class=\"distribution-row\"><span>5% ~ 7%</span><div class=\"distribution-track\"><span class=\"distribution-fill\" style=\"width:9.1973%;background:var(--sv-price-up)\"></span></div><span class=\"distribution-value\">110 家 · 1.98%</span></div><div class=\"distribution-row\"><span>7% ~ 9.8%</span><div class=\"distribution-track\"><span class=\"distribution-fill\" style=\"width:3.5117%;background:var(--sv-price-up)\"></span></div><span class=\"distribution-value\">42 家 · 0.76%</span></div><div class=\"distribution-row\"><span>高于 9.8%</span><div class=\"distribution-track\"><span class=\"distribution-fill\" style=\"width:6.9398%;background:var(--sv-price-up)\"></span></div><span class=\"distribution-value\">83 家 · 1.49%</span></div><p class=\"source-note\">下跌区间左闭右开；上涨区间左开右闭；平盘单列。不同区间互斥，合计 5560 家。涨跌幅达到 9.8% 不等于严格按板块规则认定的涨跌停。</p></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>板块结构 · 创业板最强，科创板与北交所走弱</h2><p class=\"section-summary\">同时对照上涨占比、个股中位数和成交额，区分板块内部宽度与加权指数。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"wide-table\"><thead><tr><th>板块 / 有效样本</th><th>上涨占比</th><th>涨跌幅中位数</th><th>成交额（亿元）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>沪市主板<small class=\"name-code\">1698 家</small></td><td><div class=\"ratio-inline\"><span class=\"ratio-track\"><span class=\"ratio-fill\" style=\"width:52.7%\"></span></span><span class=\"ratio-text\">52.7%</span></div></td><td><span class=\"up\">+0.17%</span></td><td>5,463</td></tr><tr><td>创业板<small class=\"name-code\">1406 家</small></td><td><div class=\"ratio-inline\"><span class=\"ratio-track\"><span class=\"ratio-fill\" style=\"width:59.1%\"></span></span><span class=\"ratio-text\">59.1%</span></div></td><td><span class=\"up\">+0.44%</span></td><td>4,509</td></tr><tr><td>深市主板<small class=\"name-code\">1490 家</small></td><td><div class=\"ratio-inline\"><span class=\"ratio-trac